{"id":"wb-7-1135","name":"金口坝","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"金口坝","text":"金口坝，位于山东省济宁市兖州市城东泗河上，是中华人民共和国全国重点文物保护单位之一。\n1992年6月12日，公布为山东省文物保护单位，2013年5月公布为全国重点文物保护单位，是一座古建筑及历史纪念建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%8F%A3%E5%9D%9D","revisionId":86787030,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86787030","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3a31146f8fb02a2096a6b374.jpg","title":"Yanzhou Jinkou Ba 2015.08.13 13-51-32.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yanzhou_Jinkou_Ba_2015.08.13_13-51-32.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/Yanzhou_Jinkou_Ba_2015.08.13_13-51-32.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"兖州金口坝","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata P373 专属相册：Jinkou Dam","categorySourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Jinkou_Dam"}}